---
interface Props {
  promptText: string;
}

const { promptText } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="space-y-3" aria-labelledby="prompt-source-title">
  <h2 id="prompt-source-title" class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
    🤖 AI 프롬프트 원문
  </h2>
  <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
    아래 프롬프트를 복사하여 AI 대화창 첫 메시지로 전달해 보세요.
  </p>
  <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-950 p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800"><code>{promptText}</code></pre>
</section>
